name colourchange
category Package
revision 21741
shortdesc Colourchange
relocated 1
longdesc The package allows you to change the colour of the structural
longdesc elements (inner theme and outer theme) of your beamer
longdesc presentation during the presentation. There is a manual option
longdesc but there is also the option to have your structure colour
longdesc change from one colour to another as a function of how far
longdesc through the presentation you are.
